        "description": "<p>After you make a Ranged attack, you Crit on subsequent Ranged attacks on a d20 roll 1 lower, and can stack up to 3 times. It resets at the end of your Turn if you didn’t hit a Ranged attack since the start of your last Turn.</p>",
